on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [  3] getglobal 6 ............................. <egozh>
  [  5] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  8] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite 30 to egozh
  [ 10] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [ 13] getglobal 10 ............................ <egozv>
  [ 15] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 18] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 30 to egozv
  [ 20] ret
end
